---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - FinCalc Pro"
  description="FinCalc Pro's privacy policy. We respect your privacy. No personal data is collected or stored by our financial calculators."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-prose mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-6">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      FinCalc Pro ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy
      Policy explains how we handle information when you visit our website and use our financial
      calculators.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <strong>We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal information.</strong> All financial
      calculations on FinCalc Pro run entirely in your browser using JavaScript. The numbers you
      enter into any calculator never leave your device. We have no accounts, no sign-ups, and no
      forms that collect personal data.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We may use anonymous analytics services (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics or similar) to
      understand general traffic patterns, such as which pages are visited most often and what
      regions our visitors come from. These services collect only aggregated, anonymized data. No
      personal information, IP addresses, or browsing histories are tracked or stored.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We use minimal cookies necessary for the operation of the website. We do not use tracking
      cookies for advertising or marketing purposes. If we display advertisements via third-party
      ad networks (such as Google AdSense, Ezoic, or Mediavine), those networks may use cookies to
      serve personalized ads based on your browsing activity. You can manage cookie preferences
      through your browser settings or via the ad network's opt-out tools.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We may use third-party services for analytics and advertising as described above. These
      providers have their own privacy policies governing their use of data. We encourage you to
      review their policies for more information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Data Security</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Because we do not collect, store, or process any user data on our servers, there is no risk
      of a data breach involving personal information from our site. All calculator inputs remain
      in your browser and are cleared when you close or refresh the page.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Our website is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect any
      personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with
      personal data, please contact us so we can investigate.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page
      with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <a href="mailto:mohitsinghatwork05@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">
        mohitsinghatwork05@gmail.com
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
